  <title id="scope-title">A request routed by message ID</title>
  <desc id="scope-desc">Bytes funnel into a FrameCodec, which cuts them into frames. The frames cross to an envelope with message ID 2 and correlation ID 7. The router matches ID 2 and sends it through middleware to the telemetry handler; the routes to the login and control handlers stay unlit. The reply returns along the floor carrying the same correlation ID.</desc>
